@startuml
title Core domain model (persisted vs derived vs concept-only)
hide methods
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Mission <<persisted>> {
  id
  name
  state : MissionState
  droneId
  earliestStart
  dispatchDeadline
  failureReason : FailureReason
  derivedFromId
}
class RouteRevision <<persisted>> {
  id
  revision
  geometry : GeoJSON LineString
  createdAt
}
class MissionResult <<persisted>> {
  id
  deviceId
  uploadedAt
}
class Measurement <<persisted>> {
  id
  capturedAt
  longitude
  latitude
  source
  rawObservations : Record<string, number>
}
class ResultRevision <<persisted>> {
  id
  revision
  rejectedMeasurementIds
  finalizedAt
  createdAt
}
class IdempotencyKey <<persisted>> {
  key
  missionId
}

class Projection <<derived, in-memory>> {
  version
  min
  max
}
class DataTile <<derived, in-memory>> {
  z / x / y
  Float32 grid (64 x 64)
}

class AdministrativeGeography <<reference data, frontend>> {
  shapeID
  shapeName
  adminLevel
  parentId
}

class Operator <<concept only>>
class Drone <<concept only>>
class OperationalArea <<concept only>>

enum MissionState {
  DRAFT
  PLANNED
  DISPATCHED
  RUNNING
  COMPLETED
  FAILED
  CANCELLED
}
enum FailureReason {
  MISSED_DISPATCH
  EXECUTION_FAILED
  DATA_INVALID
}

Mission "1" *-- "1..*" RouteRevision : routeHistory
Mission "1" --> "1" RouteRevision : activeRoute
Mission "0..1" <-- "0..*" Mission : derivedFrom
Mission "1" --> "0..1" MissionResult : produces (implicit execution)
Mission "1" o-- "0..*" IdempotencyKey
MissionResult "1" *-- "1..*" Measurement
MissionResult "1" *-- "0..*" ResultRevision : revisionHistory
MissionResult "1" --> "0..1" ResultRevision : activeRevision
ResultRevision ..> Measurement : rejects (by id)
Projection ..> ResultRevision : derived from every mission's\nactive FINALIZED revision
Projection "1" *-- "0..*" DataTile
Mission ..> MissionState
Mission ..> FailureReason

Mission ..> Drone : droneId (string only)
Operator ..> Mission : plans / reviews
OperationalArea ..> AdministrativeGeography : may reference
AdministrativeGeography ..> Mission : navigation only,\nno ownership

note right of Mission
  Route-centric (ADR-0008). Execution is implicit:
  no ExecutionAttempt entity. A failed mission
  produces a NEW derived mission, never a retry
  in place. There is no Operator, Drone or
  OperationalArea table: droneId is a plain string.
end note

note right of ResultRevision
  A revision is immutable. "Accepted" is not stored:
  a measurement is accepted iff it is not in
  rejectedMeasurementIds. Approved data exists only
  when the ACTIVE revision has finalizedAt set.
end note

note right of DataTile
  Numeric values only, NaN = no data.
  Colors are a frontend concern (ADR-0004).
end note
@enduml
